/-!
# Local charts of the 2-atom pieces (L1, L2, L3) and the triangle copy cell

Generated by `gen_configs.py` (L4 scratch; sha256 recorded in `COPIED-SHA256SUMS` as a generator, not a copy).
For every balanced orientation of the shapes of `Chart.Shapes`, an explicit local chart (M4 Prop L): local
solution, local opposite-difference coordinates, uniqueness certificate and exact phase forms. Every table is
checked by `decide` (validity, phase forms, role compatibility, relations of the input and output pairs) and
covers every balanced orientation of its shape.
-/

@[expose] public section
set_option autoImplicit false

